; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; web_check — the REAL browser seam (full rocq-runtime kernel).
;
;   dune build web/web_check.bc      links the whole pipeline to bytecode.
;   dune build web/web_check.bc.js   runs js_of_ocaml over it (whole-program).
;
; To produce a build that actually RUNS, compile it against the coerce-32bit
; OCAMLPATH overlay built by web/build-real.sh (a patched, Int64-backed
; rocq-runtime kernel.cma). Built against the stock native rocq-runtime the
; emitted JS instead TRAPS at startup on the kernel's `Sys.word_size = 64`
; assertion (kernel/uint63_63.ml) — see BACKEND.md sections 1c-2. Always use
; web/build-real.sh, which sets the overlay and bundles the runtime shims.
;
; runtime_shims.js : thread/getpid no-ops, Float64 primitives (called at init),
;                    benign init-time VM tcode stubs (VM disabled via vm:false).
; zarith_stubs.js  : Jane Street zarith_stubs_js (pure-JS ml_z_* — zarith 1.14).
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; The Corelib prelude declares ML modules (cc, firstorder, number_string_notation,
; ltac, tauto) and stdlib/mathcomp need more. jsoo has no Dynlink, so every
; plugin the mounted .vo can [Declare ML Module] must be STATICALLY linked here
; (its tactic/notation/grammar extensions register at module init) and its
; findlib package resolved from a stripped META in the VFS (web_check.ml mounts
; one with archive/plugin removed, so Rocq's findlib lookup succeeds but loads
; nothing — the code is already linked). Adding a plugin here is what makes the
; corresponding [Declare ML Module] a no-op instead of a Dynlink failure.
(executable
 (name web_check)
 (modules web_check)
 (modes byte js)
 (link_flags (-linkall))
 (libraries
  rocq_comparator js_of_ocaml yojson findlib
  rocq-runtime.plugins.ltac
  rocq-runtime.plugins.cc_core
  rocq-runtime.plugins.cc
  rocq-runtime.plugins.firstorder_core
  rocq-runtime.plugins.firstorder
  rocq-runtime.plugins.number_string_notation
  rocq-runtime.plugins.tauto)
 (js_of_ocaml
  (compilation_mode whole_program)
  (javascript_files runtime_shims.js zarith_stubs.js)))
